{"availability":"available","full":"Nexlm/nexlm","name":"nexlm","description":"Nexlm is a peer-to-peer Stellar exchange built for Nigeria, sell XLM, get paid in Naira, no middleman, no delays.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":3,"created":"2026-09-13T14:15:15Z","updated":"2026-10-05T21:17:06Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://nexlm-client.vercel.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://nexlm-client.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:55:54.473Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T17:55:54.473Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T17:55:54.473Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:55:54.473Z","stars":0,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Peer-to-peer XLM ↔ Naira exchange with on-chain Stellar escrow.","Nexlm lets Nigerians buy and sell XLM directly with each other using bank transfer, OPay, PalmPay, Kuda and Moniepoint. The seller's XLM is locked in a dedicated Stellar escrow account for every trade, so neither side has to trust the other — and Nexlm never touches the Naira."],"features":["Accounts — email registration and verification, password reset, JWT sessions, rate-limited auth","Stellar wallet — a keypair is generated per user (secret encrypted with AES-256-GCM), funded by Friendbot on testnet; balances, QR deposits, withdrawals and on-chain activity via Horizon","KYC — BVN/NIN verification through Smile ID, with manual admin review as a fallback; only a keyed fingerprint and last four digits are stored","P2P order board — buy and sell orders with price, payment methods and terms, sorted best price first, auto-expiring after 30 minutes","Escrow trades — per-trade escrow lock, 15-minute payment window, mark as paid, release, cancel and automatic refunds on timeout"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nexlm/nexlm/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bd6e2fd42b27bf288828a54e1cf77e77898fc007b7f3f22b0bd4291ddc8680c2","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:55:54.602Z"},"overviewCheck